WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
- [Kelly] So, you just
wrapped "The Good Place."

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.380
- Yeah, we did.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.213
- Great show.

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:05.046
Do you have any favorite memories?

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:05.879
- Thank you.

00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:09.160
All of them are, all the moments
were just great memories.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.060
I mean, I get to work
with like the best people.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.040
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.680
- TV legend Ted Danson.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.513
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh, right?

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:16.190
- Super mom Kristen Bell.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.660
But like most of my memories are with Ted,

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.890
and like he's just, you
know, the biggest goofball.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:20.723
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:21.781
- Like especially when the sun comes down

00:00:21.781 --> 00:00:23.710
and the moon's out.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.020
Like and there's a lot of
sugar that goes around on set.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.440
- Oh, I was like, does
he become a werewolf?

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.276
What's happening?

00:00:28.276 --> 00:00:29.550
I was like, okay.
- Close, almost.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.420
Like there was this moment
where me and my other,

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.310
you had him on the show, so
Will, William Jackson Harper.

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.180
- Yes, yeah.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.730
- We were just having
a conversation with Ted

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.210
and we were just fooling around

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:40.690
and then I was talking to Will

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.370
and then I hear a noise
over in Ted's corner.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.164
And then like a gurgling breathing noise.

00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:46.997
- Oh.

00:00:46.997 --> 00:00:49.490
- And then I just look
at Ted and, you know,

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:50.620
like are you okay?

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.710
And then we go about our business.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:53.670
And then I hear it again.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.730
And then I look closer.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.840
And then there's like
something like red and gooey

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.340
up Ted's nose.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:00.760
And then he takes a breath.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.593
- What?

00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:02.530
- And then he goes (snorting quickly),

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:07.340
and then he snorts out
this Swedish fish gummy.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:08.173
Yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:01:08.173 --> 00:01:10.714
This is a 70-year-old man doing this.

00:01:10.714 --> 00:01:11.547
Yeah.

00:01:11.547 --> 00:01:12.380
- Well, I'd be like, why did you do that?

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:13.880
I don't care, I'm just in.

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.977
Like that's so funny.
- Yeah.

